Scope note
----------
The MIT licence above covers the source code of this package (agent/, core/,
skill/, tool/, utils/, localization/, tools/, scripts and configuration).

The files under data/ are research data, not code:
  * crash reports and reproducers under data/datasets/ originate from syzbot
    (https://syzkaller.appspot.com) and are redistributed here as inputs;
  * kernel patches, commit messages and derived knowledge bases contain
    material from the Linux kernel, which is licensed under GPL-2.0.
Redistribute or reuse those files under the terms of their original sources.
